{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Snap Markup》是一款相片標註與編輯工具，適合需要快速整理截圖、文件、收據、物業相片或日常照片的用家。它結合裝置端 AI、專業編輯工具與簡易分享流程，可把相片轉成標註清晰、易於傳送的成品；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-184.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一站式標註與掃描</h2>\n<p>統一工具列可裁剪、旋轉、繪圖、加入文字、貼紙與疊加層，並可重排常用工具；文件掃描支援多頁自動邊緣偵測與校正，輸出清晰影像或可搜尋 PDF。另備智能裁切、背景模糊、重點標示與像素化遮蔽敏感資料，所有 AI 處理均於裝置上完成。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-198-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-199-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-200-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-201-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-202-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-203-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Snap Markup – Annotation Tool</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/snap-markup-annotation-tool/id1012363691?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:29:36.965190+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:13:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:33:52.398326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:22:59.442919+00:00","content_hash":"1bda6c688d784bdccf852a25aa5ecc421b16e3d1f6662e2706778c84398b1fd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}